{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "kjv-psalms-018",
  "collection": "kjv-bible",
  "document_type": "bible_chapter",
  "number": 18,
  "title": "Psalms 18",
  "display_title": "Psalms 18",
  "translation": "King James Version",
  "translationCode": "KJV",
  "bookId": "psalms",
  "book": "Psalms",
  "bookName": "Psalms",
  "bookOrder": 19,
  "testament": "old",
  "chapter": 18,
  "sortOrder": 19018,
  "verseCount": 50,
  "aliases": [
    "Psalm",
    "Psalms",
    "Ps",
    "Psa",
    "Psm"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "I will love thee, O LORD, my strength.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "The LORD is my rock, and my fortress, and my deliverer; my God, my strength, in whom I will trust; my buckler, and the horn of my salvation, and my high tower.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "I will call upon the LORD, who is worthy to be praised: so shall I be saved from mine enemies.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "The sorrows of death compassed me, and the floods of ungodly men made me afraid.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "The sorrows of hell compassed me about: the snares of death prevented me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "In my distress I called upon the LORD, and cried unto my God: he heard my voice out of his temple, and my cry came before him, even into his ears.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Then the earth shook and trembled; the foundations also of the hills moved and were shaken, because he was wroth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "There went up a smoke out of his nostrils, and fire out of his mouth devoured: coals were kindled by it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "He bowed the heavens also, and came down: and darkness was under his feet.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "And he rode upon a cherub, and did fly: yea, he did fly upon the wings of the wind.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "He made darkness his secret place; his pavilion round about him were dark waters and thick clouds of the skies.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "At the brightness that was before him his thick clouds passed, hail stones and coals of fire.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "The LORD also thundered in the heavens, and the Highest gave his voice; hail stones and coals of fire.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "Yea, he sent out his arrows, and scattered them; and he shot out lightnings, and discomfited them.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "Then the channels of waters were seen, and the foundations of the world were discovered at thy rebuke, O LORD, at the blast of the breath of thy nostrils.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "He sent from above, he took me, he drew me out of many waters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "He delivered me from my strong enemy, and from them which hated me: for they were too strong for me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "They prevented me in the day of my calamity: but the LORD was my stay.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "He brought me forth also into a large place; he delivered me, because he delighted in me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "The LORD rewarded me according to my righteousness; according to the cleanness of my hands hath he recompensed me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "For I have kept the ways of the LORD, and have not wickedly departed from my God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "For all his judgments were before me, and I did not put away his statutes from me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "I was also upright before him, and I kept myself from mine iniquity.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "Therefore hath the LORD recompensed me according to my righteousness, according to the cleanness of my hands in his eyesight.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "With the merciful thou wilt shew thyself merciful; with an upright man thou wilt shew thyself upright;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "With the pure thou wilt shew thyself pure; and with the froward thou wilt shew thyself froward.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "For thou wilt save the afflicted people; but wilt bring down high looks.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:27"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-028",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 28,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:28",
      "numberLabel": "28",
      "text": "For thou wilt light my candle: the LORD my God will enlighten my darkness.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:28",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:28"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-029",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 29,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:29",
      "numberLabel": "29",
      "text": "For by thee I have run through a troop; and by my God have I leaped over a wall.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:29",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:29"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-030",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 30,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:30",
      "numberLabel": "30",
      "text": "As for God, his way is perfect: the word of the LORD is tried: he is a buckler to all those that trust in him.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:30",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:30"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-031",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 31,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:31",
      "numberLabel": "31",
      "text": "For who is God save the LORD? or who is a rock save our God?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:31",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-032",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 32,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:32",
      "numberLabel": "32",
      "text": "It is God that girdeth me with strength, and maketh my way perfect.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:32",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:32"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-033",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 33,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:33",
      "numberLabel": "33",
      "text": "He maketh my feet like hinds’ feet, and setteth me upon my high places.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:33",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:33"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-034",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 34,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:34",
      "numberLabel": "34",
      "text": "He teacheth my hands to war, so that a bow of steel is broken by mine arms.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:34",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:34"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-035",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 35,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:35",
      "numberLabel": "35",
      "text": "Thou hast also given me the shield of thy salvation: and thy right hand hath holden me up, and thy gentleness hath made me great.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:35",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:35"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-036",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 36,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:36",
      "numberLabel": "36",
      "text": "Thou hast enlarged my steps under me, that my feet did not slip.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:36",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:36"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-037",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 37,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:37",
      "numberLabel": "37",
      "text": "I have pursued mine enemies, and overtaken them: neither did I turn again till they were consumed.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:37",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:37"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-038",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 38,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:38",
      "numberLabel": "38",
      "text": "I have wounded them that they were not able to rise: they are fallen under my feet.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:38",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:38"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-039",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 39,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:39",
      "numberLabel": "39",
      "text": "For thou hast girded me with strength unto the battle: thou hast subdued under me those that rose up against me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:39",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:39"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-040",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 40,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:40",
      "numberLabel": "40",
      "text": "Thou hast also given me the necks of mine enemies; that I might destroy them that hate me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:40",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:40"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-041",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 41,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:41",
      "numberLabel": "41",
      "text": "They cried, but there was none to save them: even unto the LORD, but he answered them not.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:41",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:41"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-042",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 42,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:42",
      "numberLabel": "42",
      "text": "Then did I beat them small as the dust before the wind: I did cast them out as the dirt in the streets.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:42",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:42"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-043",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 43,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:43",
      "numberLabel": "43",
      "text": "Thou hast delivered me from the strivings of the people; and thou hast made me the head of the heathen: a people whom I have not known shall serve me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:43",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:43"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-044",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 44,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:44",
      "numberLabel": "44",
      "text": "As soon as they hear of me, they shall obey me: the strangers shall submit themselves unto me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:44",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:44"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-045",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 45,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:45",
      "numberLabel": "45",
      "text": "The strangers shall fade away, and be afraid out of their close places.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:45",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:45"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-046",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 46,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:46",
      "numberLabel": "46",
      "text": "The LORD liveth; and blessed be my rock; and let the God of my salvation be exalted.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:46",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:46"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-047",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 47,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:47",
      "numberLabel": "47",
      "text": "It is God that avengeth me, and subdueth the people under me.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:47",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:47"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-048",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 48,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:48",
      "numberLabel": "48",
      "text": "He delivereth me from mine enemies: yea, thou liftest me up above those that rise up against me: thou hast delivered me from the violent man.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:48",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:48"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-049",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 49,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:49",
      "numberLabel": "49",
      "text": "Therefore will I give thanks unto thee, O LORD, among the heathen, and sing praises unto thy name.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:49",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:49"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-050",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 50,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:18:50",
      "numberLabel": "50",
      "text": "Great deliverance giveth he to his king; and sheweth mercy to his anointed, to David, and to his seed for evermore.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 18:50",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:18:50"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
